{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Book me a flight from New York to Paris for tomorrow (2024-06-15). Execute the complete booking workflow.\n\nPassenger details:\n- Name: John Smith\n- Email: john.smith@example.com\n- Seat preference: window\n- Travel class: economy"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to book a flight from New York to Paris for tomorrow (2024-06-15). They've provided all the necessary passenger details.\n\nAccording to the workflow I must follow:\n1. STEP 1: First call get_weather and get_time for destination (Paris)\n2. STEP 2: After receiving weather/time data, call check_flight_schedule\n3. STEP 3: After receiving flight schedule, call book_flight with user details\n4. STEP 4: After booking confirmation, provide final summary\n\nLet me start with STEP 1 - getting weather and time for Paris. These two calls are independent, so I can make them together.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll help you book a flight from New York to Paris. Let me execute the complete booking workflow.\n\n**STEP 1: Getting destination information (Paris)**"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HfWxcJf1sAnJg493WnTcn4","name":"get_weather","input":{"city":"Paris","units":"celsius"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TrDttRkGTUpRBh1cgbBLMD","name":"get_time","input":{"city":"Paris","format":"24h"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01HfWxcJf1sAnJg493WnTcn4","content":"Weather in Paris: Sunny, 18°C, humidity 65%, light breeze from west"}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01TrDttRkGTUpRBh1cgbBLMD","content":"Current time in Paris: 14:30 CET (UTC+1)","cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"5m"}}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"You are an automated flight booking assistant. You MUST follow this exact workflow:\n\nSTEP 1: When user requests a flight, FIRST call get_weather and get_time for destination\nSTEP 2: After receiving weather/time data, NEXT call check_flight_schedule\nSTEP 3: After receiving flight schedule, NEXT call book_flight with user details\nSTEP 4: After booking confirmation, provide final summary to user\n\nCRITICAL: You must call ALL required tools in sequence. Do not skip steps or summarize prematurely.","cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"5m"}}],"max_tokens":4096,"stream":true,"temperature":1,"tools":[{"name":"get_weather","description":"IncrCacheTest-rtrue-strue-v2 Get current weather conditions for a specified city. Returns temperature, conditions, humidity, and wind speed.","input_schema":{"properties":{"city":{"description":"The city name to get weather for","type":"string"},"units":{"description":"Temperature unit preference","enum":["celsius","fahrenheit"],"type":"string"}},"required":["city"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"get_time","description":"IncrCacheTest-rtrue-strue-v2 Get current local time for a specified city with timezone information. Returns time in 24-hour format along with timezone offset.","input_schema":{"properties":{"city":{"description":"The city name to get time for","type":"string"},"format":{"description":"Time format preference","enum":["12h","24h"],"type":"string"}},"required":["city"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"check_flight_schedule","description":"IncrCacheTest-rtrue-strue-v2 Check available flight schedules between two cities on a specified date. Returns flight numbers, departure/arrival times, airlines, and available seats.","input_schema":{"properties":{"class":{"description":"Preferred travel class","enum":["economy","business","first"],"type":"string"},"date":{"description":"Flight date in YYYY-MM-DD format","type":"string"},"destination":{"description":"Destination city or airport code","type":"string"},"origin":{"description":"Origin city or airport code","type":"string"}},"required":["origin","destination","date"],"type":"object"}},{"name":"book_flight","description":"IncrCacheTest-rtrue-strue-v2 Book a flight ticket for specified flight number and passenger details. Returns booking confirmation number and total price.","input_schema":{"properties":{"flight_number":{"description":"Flight number from schedule","type":"string"},"passenger_email":{"description":"Email for booking confirmation","type":"string"},"passenger_name":{"description":"Full name of passenger","type":"string"},"seat_preference":{"description":"Seat location preference","enum":["window","aisle","middle"],"type":"string"}},"required":["flight_number","passenger_name","passenger_email"],"type":"object"},"cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"5m"}}],"thinking":{"type":"enabled","budget_tokens":1024}}HTTP/2.0 200 OK
